# Your Crystal Ball (jeuno 9) at Jeuno fame level 1 ((33 + 33 + 33) / 2 = 49): no section; Kurou-Morou's default 193.
# Available, the Rockwell pool has no section either (section 1 names only Kurou-Morou): its default WATER_POOL, and a
# lens there while available (no trade handler: nil).
lists LowerJeuno/Kurou-Morou/onTrigger MazeOfShakhrami/Rockwell/onTrigger MazeOfShakhrami/Rockwell/onTrade
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-1,-6.7,-29 job=WAR lvl=30
fame Sandoria 33
fame Bastok 33
fame Windurst 33
item AhrimanLens
login
trigger Kurou-Morou                         # fame level 1: no section; default 193
finish
warp -18,-14,181.5 MazeOfShakhrami
trigger Rockwell                            # available: no section; WATER_POOL
trade Rockwell AhrimanLens x1               # available: no trade handler, nil
